  "description": "For 15 years, Han Cho-Eun gave her all to actor Park Eun-Ho as his friend, his stylist, and eventually his lover. However, her heart is broken when she finds Eun-Ho cheating, exposing what a cruel \"beast\" he truly is. Determined to get revenge, Cho-Eun starts working for rival actor Cha Do-Jin and tries to seduce him one night while drunk. Though Cho-Eun only does this to show Eun-Ho she's moved on, Do-Jin surprisingly agrees to be seduced further! But will vengeance be as stylish as Cho-Eun imagines?\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
